msgid ""
"A fast model writes a draft while you speak. When you stop, the whole "
"recording is transcribed again with the model of the engine, which is "
"more accurate."
msgstr ""
"Un modelo rápido escribe un borrador mentres falas. Cando paras, toda a "
"gravación vólvese transcribir co modelo do motor, que é máis preciso."

